     "description": "In what would be Mike Modano\u2019s final home game donning a Dallas Stars uniform, the crowd at American Airlines Center honored him with a heartwarming standing ovation during the third period of Dallas' game against the Anaheim Ducks on April 8, 2010. Moments later, Modano thrilled them by scoring the game-tying goal with a tip-in off a point shot with less than two minutes remaining in regulation. After a scoreless overtime, the game went to a shootout. With the fans on their feet, Modano skated in and snapped a shot past Ducks netminder Jonas Hiller resulting in thunderous cheers from fans in the American Airlines Center. The Stars went on to win the game 3-2 in the shootout.\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
